@page "/features"

<PageTitle>Features</PageTitle>

<div class="panel-shell">
    <div class="panel-header">
        <div>
            <h1>Platform capabilities</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Alfa combines local enforcement, cloud sync, and visibility into one modern security platform.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature-card">
            <h2>Policy orchestration</h2>
            <p>Define, deploy, and manage rules from a central interface with consistent enforcement across devices.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
            <h2>Secure local core</h2>
            <p>The C++ enforcement engine validates commands using HMAC and holds policy state in SQLite for resilience.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
            <h2>Live telemetry</h2>
            <p>Audit every command and track compliance with real-time telemetry cards and event streams.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
            <h2>Developer-first CLI</h2>
            <p>Script and automate deployments using a polished CLI with secure command delivery and diagnostics.</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</div>
